sequenceDiagram
  participant C as External lab session
  participant I as Controlled ingress
  participant S as Rules and shared store
  participant D as No-import Wasm decoy
  participant B as Synthetic production-like backend
  C->>I: Prohibited tool and distinct denied probes
  I-->>C: Deny each prohibited request
  I->>S: Authenticated observations and outbox
  S->>S: Corroborate D-002 or D-006
  S->>S: Fence production dispatch and RESTRICT
  alt Eligible and verified template
    S->>S: DECOY_PENDING, isolated synthetic assignment
    S->>S: Commit DECOY route and version
    C->>I: Next supported nontransactional request
    I->>D: Synthetic operation only
    D-->>I: Simulated result
    I-->>C: Bounded synthetic response
  else Missing readiness, policy or budget
    I-->>C: Remain restricted or deny
  end
  Note over I,B: No production dispatch after acknowledged route fence
  Note over S,D: No automatic return to production
